  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Linear acceleration of cylinder is zero, i.e.,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mg</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ( here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>&nbsp;= frictional force upwards )</p><p>Angular acceleration about the centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>fR</mtext><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mtext>mR</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>2f</mtext><mtext>mR</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>2mg sin</mtext><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mtext>mR</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>2g sin</mtext><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br />For no slipping between cylinder and plank</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>R</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>2g sin</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math></p>"
